sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  accTitle: A sequence diagram fixture
  accDescr: Every sequence element the diagram styles cover: actors, numbered solid and dashed messages, a note, an activation and a loop.
  participant S as Server
  participant B as Browser
  S->>B: the markup
  activate B
  Note over B: shown scaled
  loop every update
    B->>B: render
  end
  B-->>S: fetch new data
  deactivate B
